# Atlas Core Design System - Component Tokens Specification
**Author:** Juno Marlow  
**Department:** Design  
**Project:** Atlas Core  
**Produced:** D15 04:50  
**Inputs used:** Business Document (Company Document)  
## Summary

Component tokens specification and configuration for Atlas Core, aligning UI component variables with brand and functional requirements derived from Business Document: Company Document.

## Deliverable
```
{
  "$schema": "https://design-tokens.github.io/community-group/format/",
  "meta": {
    "projectName": "Atlas Core",
    "author": "Juno Marlow",
    "documentation": "Referenced guidelines in 'Business Document: Company Document' to standardize multi-tenant SaaS theming alongside face-to-face operational touchpoints."
  },
  "button": {
    "primary": {
      "background": {
        "value": "{color.brand.primary}",
        "type": "color",
        "description": "Primary CTA background mapped from Business Document: Company Document accessibility rules."
      },
      "text": {
        "value": "{color.neutral.0}",
        "type": "color"
      },
      "padding": {
        "x": { "value": "{space.md}", "type": "dimension" },
        "y": { "value": "{space.sm}", "type": "dimension" }
      },
      "border-radius": {
        "value": "{radius.sm}",
        "type": "dimension"
      }
    }
  },
  "card": {
    "surface": {
      "background": {
        "value": "{color.surface.default}",
        "type": "color"
      },
      "border": {
        "value": "{color.border.subtle}",
        "type": "color"
      },
      "elevation": {
        "value": "{elevation.card.default}",
        "type": "shadow"
      }
    }
  },
  "input": {
    "border": {
      "default": { "value": "{color.border.strong}", "type": "color" },
      "focus": { "value": "{color.brand.primary}", "type": "color" },
      "error": { "value": "{color.feedback.danger}", "type": "color" }
    },
    "typography": {
      "font-family": { "value": "{font.family.base}", "type": "fontFamily" },
      "font-size": { "value": "{font.size.base}", "type": "fontSize" }
    }
  }
}
```